  "implementation": [
    "Core/Handlers.with_job borrow caller F& through stack POD action; separate void/value payload, reference results excluded. Caller retains facade/action/checkpoint/Parent Operation/Runtime/Online/authentication/lower lifetimes. Copied permit never extends Operation.",
    "Separate actor/busy/checking/binding guards and stack descriptors for Core/Handlers. Publish before probes; all Parent/checkpoint/opaque operations outside metadata gates. Core.check -> Handler.check metadata/permit only; Handler final scope proof does not call Core after its child scope ends.",
    "Only action NoResponse is captured as possible control; all normal/control completions must validate then unpublish both scopes. Probe/completion same-marker exceptions poison and convert to logic_error without retry. SDK/XML/diagnostic unknowns remain poisoned. Creator-only binding/clear/destruction retained.",
    "Core known/no-pending GuardedFiles is required for normal/control completion. Errors unpublish descriptors without speculative file close/delete/replay; retained owners use stable Impl checkpoint rather than stack descriptor.",
    "Graph concrete-only Licensing adapter supplies exact JobCall Parent/permit and POD Graph admission, holding shared provider. Three handlers and independent unknown diagnostic select same helper; diagnostic remains control=false. Default CheckedCalls route preserved."
  ],
